# =============================================================================
# MarkerFlow — .gitignore
# Keep the repository to code, configuration, docs, and the small example data.
# Never commit reference databases or generated pipeline output.
# =============================================================================

# --- Reference databases (2+ GB — download separately, see INSTALL.md) -------
databases/

# --- Generated pipeline output ------------------------------------------------
results/
# Legacy output layout (pre-1.0.0), if any copies remain locally
pipeline_*/

# --- Project-level logs -------------------------------------------------------
/logs/

# --- Internal development notes (not part of the public release) --------------
CLAUDE_BRIEFING.md
SESSION_RESUME.md
GITHUB_SETUP.md

# --- Editor / tooling ---------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# --- OS cruft -----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# NOTE: RAW_dataset/ IS committed on purpose — it is the small example dataset
# used to test the pipeline (18S / ITS / 16S). Do not add it here.
